Additional checks:
- GPU source/encoding tests: 10 passed, using cargo oxide test --arch sm_89 --
  --release -p cq-gpu-tpch --lib source::. The importer unwraps the CPU shell and
  retains all stages, aggregate heads, preprocessing, and materialization.
- mini-linq-macros library tests: 15 passed. The generic plan parser now accepts
  no_reduce with explicit reduce advice (needed by H21 and D27); skip still must
  name an existing Masks reduction, so no_reduce + skip is rejected semantically.
- python3 doc/formal/check.py: 243 rules inventoried; no conformance claim.
